WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.096
Wagatijan tɛmɛninw na, sagagbɛnbaga dɔ tun be Sahɛli mara la min tɔgɔ ko Samba.

00:00:07.176 --> 00:00:12.546
A bɛmacɛ tun y'a fɔ a ye ko a ka denbayamɔgɔw ka sagaw mara.

00:00:12.626 --> 00:00:16.724
O misiw tun cɛ ka ɲi ani u tun be gɔnijanw kɛ.

00:00:16.804 --> 00:00:30.621
Sani cɛkɔrɔba ye a bla ka taga, a k'a fɔ a ye ko: " Ni i tagara ni i ta bɛganw ye yɔrɔ o yɔrɔ, i hakiri to a ra ko mɔgɔ min ka o ji min, o tigi tɛ o min.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:30.801
"

00:00:30.792 --> 00:00:33.528
San o san, sanjiba tun ka jugu.

00:00:33.608 --> 00:00:39.886
Kɔgɔjiw bɛɛ tun bɛ ɲigi ɲɔgɔn kan, binw tun bɛ yɛlɛma ka kɛ buguri ye.

00:00:39.966 --> 00:00:43.701
Lon o lon, Samba tun bɛ tagama ka taga ɲa.

00:00:43.781 --> 00:00:49.332
A ta misiw tun ka minlɔgɔba sɔrɔ, o tun bɛ ŋuna ka bɔ sɛgɛ ra.

00:00:49.412 --> 00:00:53.329
Loon dɔ sufɛ, a ye kɔlɔn dɔ sɔrɔ dun fla cɛ.

00:00:53.409 --> 00:00:57.416
Jii tun gwɛnin lo, a tun man jan kalo jukɔrɔ.

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:09.224
K'a to o ta bɛganw na, kumakanba dɔ bɔra ji ra k'a fɔ ko: ‹Jɔn le b'a fɛ ka gbara ne bamuso ra?› O y'a sɔrɔ jinamɔgɔ dɔ tun bɛ yi.

00:01:09.304 --> 00:01:15.038
A tun ka bon i ko yiriba, a bonbosi tun fanin bɛ jɛnɛtuganiw na.

00:01:15.118 --> 00:01:20.760
Samba siranna kosɛbɛ, nka a hakili jigira a bɛmacɛ ta kumaw ra.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.394
A ye jinɛ nin fo ni bonya ye.

00:01:23.474 --> 00:01:28.753
O kɔ, a ye sira ɲini a fɛ ko a k'a ka sagakuruw sɔn jii la.

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:34.657
Mɛlɛkɛ k'a jaabi ko: " A to ne ye dɔ min, nka o ye kɛ saba le ye.

00:01:34.737 --> 00:01:44.195
I kana a to i ta bɛganw ye ne ta badaw dɔndɔn; i kana ne ta ji nɔgɔ, nka i ye dɔ di i ta duruja nataw ma.

00:01:44.275 --> 00:01:44.375
"

00:01:44.365 --> 00:01:50.099
Samba k'a ta misiw bɛɛ kelen kelen ji di o ma, ka o bla bada ra.

00:01:50.179 --> 00:01:53.823
A be to k'a ka sinsin fitini dɔrɔn le fa.

00:01:53.903 --> 00:01:59.727
O dugusagbɛ, sagagbɛnbaga wɛrɛ nana ni sagakuru belebeleba dɔ ye.

00:01:59.807 --> 00:02:04.450
A tun b'a yɛrɛ lɔgɔbɔra lɔnnikɛbaga ta kokɛcogow ra.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:07.720
A k'a ta bɛganw bɛɛ firi dingɛ kɔnɔ.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:12.352
Ayiwa, o ka bɔgɔ kɔrɔta, k'a kɛ ji ye ɲagaminin ye.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:15.713
O yɔrɔnin bɛɛ, ji bɔra cɛncɛn jukɔrɔ.

00:02:15.793 --> 00:02:20.981
Ayiwa, o sagagbɛnbaga yɛrɛyirabaga ka kan ka sekɔ ka taga.

00:02:21.061 --> 00:02:27.340
A k'a fɔ Samba ye ko: " Ele min tun bɛ bonya la ji kan, i bɛna a sɔrɔ.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:34.606
" Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ ko san o san, Samba tun bɛ to k'a sɔrɔ a tun ka ca yɔrɔ kelen na.

00:02:34.686 --> 00:02:43.962
Ayiwa, a nana kɔrɔ tuma min na, a k'a bɛmacɛ ta kumaw fɔ a mamadenw ye, ka dɔ fara a yɛrɛ ta kumaw kan.

00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:46.778
A ko: " Ji ye mɔgɔ dɔ ta le ye.

00:02:46.858 --> 00:02:49.230
" N'i y'a tɔɔrɔ, a be taga.
